OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after Warrington flat
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being seriously
OL,7,Finjured in a flat fire in Warrington.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to Teal
OL,10,FGrove in Birchwood at about 10:10 BST
OL,11,Fon 22 September.
OL,13,FFirefighters rescued a 58-year-old man
OL,14,Ffrom the property before he was taken
OL,15,Fto Whiston Hospital.
OL,17,FCheshire Police said he had since died
OL,18,Fdespite the efforts of emergency
OL,19,Fservices and medical staff.
